{"surface":"கரையும்","parts":[{"text":"கரை","lemma":"karai","gloss":"bellow/call out"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"habitual suffix"}],"gloss":"bellows"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அஞ்சுவரு","parts":[{"text":"அஞ்சு","lemma":"añcu","gloss":"fear"},{"text":"வரு","lemma":"varu","gloss":"come/cause"}],"gloss":"fear-inducing"},{"surface":"பொழுதினான்","parts":[{"text":"பொழுது","lemma":"poḻutu","gloss":"time"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"oblique suffix"},{"text":"ஆன்","lemma":"āṉ","gloss":"locative suffix"}],"gloss":"at the time"},{"surface":"உம்","parts":[{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"கண்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"eyes"}],"gloss":"eyes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துஞ்சா","parts":[{"text":"துஞ்சு","lemma":"tuñcu","gloss":"sleep"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ā","gloss":"not (negative suffix)"}],"gloss":"do not sleep"},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"vāḻi","gloss":"may you live long"}],"gloss":"may you live long"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"காவலர்","parts":[{"text":"காவல்","lemma":"kāval","gloss":"guarding"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"ar","gloss":"persons"}],"gloss":"guards"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கணக்காய்","parts":[{"text":"கணக்கு","lemma":"kaṇakku","gloss":"reckoning/accounts"},{"text":"ஆய்","lemma":"āy","gloss":"examining/calculating"}],"gloss":"reckoning"},{"surface":"வகையின்","parts":[{"text":"வகை","lemma":"vakai","gloss":"manner"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"like/in"}],"gloss":"in the manner of"},{"surface":"வருந்தி","parts":[{"text":"வருந்து","lemma":"varuntu","gloss":"suffer"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"past participle suffix"}],"gloss":"suffering"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெஞ்சு","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சு","lemma":"neñcu","gloss":"heart"}],"gloss":"heart"},{"surface":"புண்ணுற்ற","parts":[{"text":"புண்","lemma":"puṇ","gloss":"wound"},{"text":"உற்ற","lemma":"uṟṟa","gloss":"having attained"}],"gloss":"having been wounded"},{"surface":"விழுமத்தானே","parts":[{"text":"விழுமத்தானே","lemma":"விழுமத்தானே","gloss":"due to distress indeed"}],"gloss":"due to distress indeed","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"As the old rain poured, losing its texture and melting, / of the blighted pods of sesame, during the last days of sparse rain, / weary of standing in the mud, the red-eyed black buffalo / at dense midnight bellows with a sound of distress, / even at that fearful time, my eyes / do not sleep, may you live long, O friend! Like the guards / who suffer by reckoning accounts, my / heart is wounded due to this distress.","translation":"O friend, may you live long! During the final days of sparse rain, when the old rains have poured and melted the blighted pods of sesame, a red-eyed black buffalo, weary of standing in the deep mud, bellows in distress in the dead of night. Even at that terrifying hour, my eyes do not close in sleep. My heart is wounded and suffers in distress, like guards who grow weary from counting the hours of their watch.","modern":"பழைய மழை பொழிந்ததால் பதம் அழிந்து உருகிப்போன, உள்ளீடு இல்லாத சிதட்டு எள்ளின் காய்களைக் கொண்ட சில்பெயல் காலத்துக் கடைசி நாட்களில், சேற்றில் நின்று அலுத்துப்போன சிவந்த கண்களைக் கொண்ட கரிய எருமை மாடு, நள்ளிரவில் துன்பத்தோடு கத்துகிறது. அஞ்சத்தக்க அந்த நள்ளிரவிலும் என் கண்கள் உறங்குவதில்லை, தோழியே! காவல் காப்பவர்கள் இரவுப் பொழுதைக் கணக்கிட்டுக் களைப்படைவது போல, என் நெஞ்சம் புண்பட்டு வருந்தும் இந்தத் துன்பத்தினால் என் கண்கள் உறங்குவதில்லை.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend during the difficult period of her lover's absence. She describes the late rainy season when the sesame crop is ruined by excessive rain, leaving only hollow, blighted pods. A red-eyed buffalo, tired of standing in the cold mud, bellows in distress in the middle of the night, making the night feel even more terrifying. The buffalo's weariness and distress in the cold mud mirror the heroine's own emotional exhaustion and suffering in separation. The comparison of her wounded heart to guards who are exhausted by counting the passing hours of the night highlights her sleeplessness and the agonizingly slow passage of time.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,1.81],[1.81,2.3],[2.3,3.08],[3.08,3.7],[3.7,4.1],[4.1,4.5],[4.5,5.28],[5.28,5.9],[5.9,6.7],[6.7,7.0],[7.0,7.25],[7.25,7.73],[7.73,8.36],[8.36,9.0],[9.0,9.75],[9.75,10.2],[10.3,10.6],[10.6,11.2],[11.2,11.8],[12.0,12.3],[12.3,12.5],[12.5,13.2],[13.2,14.3],[14.3,14.59],[14.64,15.44],[15.44,16.1],[16.1,16.4],[16.4,16.7],[16.7,17.0]],"female":[[0.1,0.8],[0.8,1.59],[1.67,2.1],[2.1,2.7],[2.7,3.79],[3.79,4.5],[4.5,5.0],[5.0,5.4],[5.4,6.29],[6.29,7.0],[7.0,7.6],[7.6,7.9],[7.9,9.1],[9.1,9.46],[9.46,9.88],[9.88,10.3],[10.3,11.3],[11.3,11.9],[12.03,12.43],[12.43,13.2],[13.2,14.5],[14.5,14.9],[14.9,15.1],[15.1,15.8],[15.8,16.9],[16.9,17.4],[17.4,18.76],[19.08,19.4],[19.51,19.97],[19.97,20.2],[20.2,20.6]]},"sync":[[["பழமழை","old rain"]],[["பொழிந்தென","as it poured"],["பதனழிந்து","losing its texture"]],[["பதனழிந்து","losing its texture"]],[["பதனழிந்து","losing its texture"],["உருகிய","melted"]],[["சிதட்டுக்காய்","blighted pods"]],[["சிதட்டுக்காய்","blighted pods"],["எண்ணின்","of sesame"]],[["சில்பெயல்","sparse rain"]],[["கடைநாள்","last days"]],[["சேற்றுநிலை","standing in the mud"]],[["முனைஇய","weary of"]],[["செங்கண்","red-eyed"]],[["காரான்","black buffalo"]],[["நள்ளென்","dense"]],[["யாமத்து","at midnight"]],[["யாமத்து","at midnight"],["ஐயென","with a sound of distress"]],[["கரையும்","bellows"]],[["அஞ்சுவரு","fear-inducing"]],[["பொழுதினான்","at the time"]],[["பொழுதினான்","at the time"]],[["உம்","even"],["என்","my"],["கண்","eyes"]],[["துஞ்சா","do not sleep"]],[["வாழி","may you live long"]],[["தோழி","O friend"]],[["காவலர்","guards"]],[["கணக்காய்","reckoning"